OL,3,GNEWSAHot chilli legacy of summer
OL,4,Aheatwave
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn amateur gardener from Stoke Gifford
OL,7,Fhas produced a bumper crop of chillies
OL,8,F- boosted by the scorching hot summer.
OL,10,FJeremy Crumb only began growing the
OL,11,FSouth American plants a few years ago
OL,12,Fbut now tends dozens of varieties in
OL,13,Fhis small back garden.
OL,15,F"What's been very interesting this
OL,16,Fyear," says Crumb, "is normally it's
OL,17,Fthe plants in the greenhouse that
OL,18,Fflourish, but because of the very hot
OL,19,Fsummer even the ones outside are
OL,20,Fhealthy and absolutely stacked out with
OL,21,Ffruit.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
