OL,3,GNEWSAHot chilli legacy of summer
OL,4,Aheatwave
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I've been on a mission to produce the
OL,7,Fbiggest, healthiest chilli plants I can
OL,8,F- it's really addictive and there's so
OL,9,Fmany different varieties, they've all
OL,10,Fgot these little unique nuances to
OL,11,Fthem."
